    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/0d619f71a6028a7ffbca0f71458e0c73.poster.avif?t=1720610285\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/0d619f71a6028a7ffbca0f71458e0c73.webm?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/0d619f71a6028a7ffbca0f71458e0c73.mp4?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>1973. You are entering a world full of mysteries and horrors, taking on a new job that throws you into abandoned houses, frozen in time and filled with ghosts of the past. Your guide is the mysterious notes left in the house for you, indicating what you are to do next.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/79e06fbc0dabcba4447dfdc1ae20970c.poster.avif?t=1720610285\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/79e06fbc0dabcba4447dfdc1ae20970c.webm?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/79e06fbc0dabcba4447dfdc1ae20970c.mp4?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>There's nothing special about the main character, John. He's just an ordinary guy, with no particular skills or knowledge about the supernatural, and it's not because of a better life that he had to work as something like an exorcist. All he has is his ability to joke at the most inappropriate moments and his unique ability to talk to himself when he's scared or feeling lonely.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/80fb5c81277639ae71258def4778f563.poster.avif?t=1720610285\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/80fb5c81277639ae71258def4778f563.webm?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/80fb5c81277639ae71258def4778f563.mp4?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/261fd842b34d262f8b5f2264154e875e.webp?t=1720610285\" width=200 height=34 /></span><br>In &quot;Exiled into Darkness&quot;, you encounter souls that cannot leave these walls, and your task is to decipher what holds them here. Each house has its own unique story and its own horrors that you will have to uncover.<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/5ed8af41c222137bad18e19ef6dd7b66.poster.avif?t=1720610285\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/5ed8af41c222137bad18e19ef6dd7b66.webm?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/5ed8af41c222137bad18e19ef6dd7b66.mp4?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/0d619f71a6028a7ffbca0f71458e0c73.poster.avif?t=1720610285\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/0d619f71a6028a7ffbca0f71458e0c73.webm?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/0d619f71a6028a7ffbca0f71458e0c73.mp4?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>1973. You are entering a world full of mysteries and horrors, taking on a new job that throws you into abandoned houses, frozen in time and filled with ghosts of the past. Your guide is the mysterious notes left in the house for you, indicating what you are to do next.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/79e06fbc0dabcba4447dfdc1ae20970c.poster.avif?t=1720610285\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/79e06fbc0dabcba4447dfdc1ae20970c.webm?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803890/extras/79e06fbc0dabcba4447dfdc1ae20970c.mp4?t=1720610285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>There's nothing special about the main character, John. He's just an ordinary guy, with no particular skills or knowledge about the supernatural, and it's not because of a better life that he had to work as something like an exorcist. All he has is his ability to joke at the most inappropriate moments and his unique ability to talk to himself when he's scared or feeling lonely.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"